#: ../../source/using_rhubarb_with_opentoonz.rst:4
msgid "Using Rhubarb with OpenToonz"
msgstr "Rhubarb与OpenToonz的配合使用"

#: ../../source/using_rhubarb_with_opentoonz.rst:7
msgid "What is Rhubarb?"
msgstr "什么是Rhubarb?"

#: ../../source/using_rhubarb_with_opentoonz.rst:8
msgid ""
"Rhubarb Lip Sync is a command-line tool that automatically creates 2D "
"mouth animation from voice recordings. It can be used to provide "
"automatic lip-sync capabilities inside OpenToonz, for that to be "
"possible OpenToonz requires Rhubarb to be installed on your machine and "
"appropriately configured in Preferences."
msgstr ""
"大黄唇同步是一个命令行工具，可以从录音中自动创建2D嘴部动画。它可用于在"
"OpenToonz中提供自动唇形同步功能，为此，OpenToonz需要在您的机器上安装大黄"
"并在首选项中进行适当配置。"

#: ../../source/using_rhubarb_with_opentoonz.rst:9
msgid ""
"For more information, please visit this page: `About Rhubarb <https://"
"github.com/DanielSWolf/rhubarb-lip-sync>`_"
msgstr ""
"欲了解更多信息，请访问此页面：`关于大黄<https://github.com/DanielSWolf/"
"rhubarb-lip-sync>`_"

#: ../../source/using_rhubarb_with_opentoonz.rst:13
msgid "Installing Rhubarb for Windows"
msgstr "安装Windows版大黄"

#: ../../source/using_rhubarb_with_opentoonz.rst:16
#: ../../source/using_rhubarb_with_opentoonz.rst:41
msgid "Downloading"
msgstr "下载中"

#: ../../source/using_rhubarb_with_opentoonz.rst:18
#: ../../source/using_rhubarb_with_opentoonz.rst:43
msgid ""
"To download Rhubarb, visit this page: `Download Rhubarb <https://github."
"com/DanielSWolf/rhubarb-lip-sync/releases>`_"
msgstr ""
"要下载大黄，请访问此页面：`下载大黄<https://github.com/DanielSWolf/"
"rhubarb-lip-sync/releases>`_"

#: ../../source/using_rhubarb_with_opentoonz.rst:19
msgid ""
"Download the latest **Rhubarb-Lip-Sync-x.y.z-Windows.zip** file (where "
"'x.y.z' represent the software version number)."
msgstr ""
"下载最新的**Rhubarb-Lip-Sync-x.y.z-Windows.zip**文件（其中“x.y.z”表示软件"
"版本号）。"

#: ../../source/using_rhubarb_with_opentoonz.rst:22
#: ../../source/using_rhubarb_with_opentoonz.rst:47
msgid "Installing"
msgstr "安装"

#: ../../source/using_rhubarb_with_opentoonz.rst:24
msgid ""
"Once you have downloaded the Rhubarb zip archive, extract it in the "
"desired location of your system (**C:\\\\** is recomended)."
msgstr ""
"下载大黄zip存档后，将其解压缩到系统的所需位置（建议使用**C:\\**）。"

#: ../../source/using_rhubarb_with_opentoonz.rst:26
msgid "|rhubarb_extracted_windows|"
msgstr "|rhubarb_extracted_windows|"

#: ../../source/using_rhubarb_with_opentoonz.rst:28
#: ../../source/using_rhubarb_with_opentoonz.rst:53
msgid ""
"Next, start OpenToonz and open the Preferences window with File  →  "
"**Preferences...**"
msgstr "接下来，启动OpenToonz并使用文件打开首选项窗口→  **偏好。..**"

#: ../../source/using_rhubarb_with_opentoonz.rst:29
#: ../../source/using_rhubarb_with_opentoonz.rst:54
#: ../../source/using_rhubarb_with_opentoonz.rst:80
msgid ""
"Navigate to the **Auto Lip-Sync** category; at the top you will see a "
"box with the text **Rhubarb Path**."
msgstr ""
"导航到**自动唇部同步**类别；在顶部，您将看到一个文本框**大黄路径**。"

#: ../../source/using_rhubarb_with_opentoonz.rst:30
msgid ""
"Insert the path to your extracted Rhubarb folder (if you have used the "
"recommended path, this will be **C:\\\\Rhubarb-Lip-Sync-x.y.z-Windows\\"
"\\**):"
msgstr ""
"插入提取的大黄文件夹的路径（如果您使用了推荐的路径，这将是**C:\\"
"\\Ruhubarb-Lip-Sync-x.y.z-Windows\\\\**）："

#: ../../source/using_rhubarb_with_opentoonz.rst:32
msgid "|rhubarb_path_windows|"
msgstr "|rhubarb_path_windows|"

